  <text xml:lang="la">
    <front>
      <div xml:id="starts-on">
        <pb ed="#P" n="1107B"/>
      </div>
    </front>
    <body>
      <div xml:id="gom-prov24">
        <head xml:id="gom-prov24-Hd1e98">Caput 24</head>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov24-Dd1e100">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov24-Hd1e102">Versus 1</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov24-d1e104">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov24-Qd1e106" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov24_1@1-2">Ne aemuleris.</quote>
            Ne desideres imitari quos praedictis vitiis videris implicari; sed sapientiae operam dare curato, unde subdit: <quote xml:id="gom-prov24-Qd1e109" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov24_3@1-3">Sapientia aedificabitur domus.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov24-Dd1e114">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov24-Hd1e116">Versus 5</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov24-d1e118">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov24-Qd1e120" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov24_5@1-2">Vir sapiens.</quote>
            Non omnis fortis sapiens, <pb ed="#P" n="1107C"/> sed e converso: quia etsi corpore debilis est, si adsit sapientia, omnino fortis, adversarii, id est diaboli, certamina vincit.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov24-Dd1e127">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov24-Hd1e129">Versus 7</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov24-d1e131">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov24-Qd1e133" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov24_7@1-2">Excelsa stulto.</quote>
            Non potest stultus ad sapientiam ascendere, quia in infimis vitiorum jacet; quia etsi in praesenti se aliquid sapere putat, in porta, id est in exitu hujus vitae, nihil fuisse inveniet.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov24-Dd1e138">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov24-Hd1e140">Versus 8</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov24-d1e142">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov24-Qd1e144" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov24_8@1-2">Qui cogitat.</quote>
            Aperit, quem stultum dicat: non ingenio tardum, sed eum qui vel cogitando peccat.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov24-Dd1e150">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov24-Hd1e152">Versus 10</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov24-d1e154">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov24-Qd1e156" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov24_10@1-2">Si desperaveris.</quote>
            Nihil exsecrabilius desperatione: quam qui habuerit, et in generalibus hujus vitae laboribus, et quod pejus est, in fidei certamine, constantiam perdit.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov24-Dd1e161">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov24-Hd1e163">Versus 11</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov24-d1e165">
            <pb ed="#P" n="1107D"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov24-Qd1e169" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov24_11@1-2">Erue eos.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov24-Qd1e172"><seg type="qs">Erue eos qui ab haereticis decipiuntur</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">si algore perituros, victu, veste recrea.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov24-Dd1e181">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov24-Hd1e183">Versus 13</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov24-d1e185">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov24-Qd1e187" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov24_13@1-3">Comede, fili mi.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov24-Qd1e190"><seg type="qs">Melli et favo comparat doctrinam sapientiae</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">et mora percipitur.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov24-Dd1e199">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov24-Hd1e201">Versus 15</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov24-d1e203">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov24-Qd1e205" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov24_15@1-2">Ne insidieris.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov24-Qd1e208"><seg type="qs">Ne quaeras occasionem</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">unde subjungit:</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov24-Dd1e217">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov24-Hd1e219">Versus 16</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov24-d1e221">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov24-Qd1e223" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov24_16@1-3">Septies enim cadet.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov24-Qd1e226"><seg type="qs">Justus dicitur, et cadere</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">sic peccato assentiunt ut non poeniteant.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov24-Dd1e235">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov24-Hd1e237">Versus 17</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov24-d1e239">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov24-Qd1e241" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov24_17@1-4">Cum ceciderit inimicus tuus.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov24-Qd1e244"><seg type="qs">Supra justo insidias vetuit</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">ne te cadente in peccato, ille resipiscens sanetur.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov24-Dd1e254">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov24-Hd1e256">Versus 21</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov24-d1e258">
            <pb ed="#P" n="1108A"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov24-Qd1e262" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov24_21@1-4">Time Dominum, fili mi.</quote>
            Potest per Dominum et regem, Pater et Filius intelligi, qui eodem divinitatis honore colendi sunt: <quote xml:id="gom-prov24-Qd1e265" source="http://scta.info/resource/io5_23@8-17">Qui enim non honorificat Filium, non honorificat Patrem, qui misit illum,</quote> etc. <!--<note>(Joan. III)</note>-->.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov24-d1e271">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov24-Qd1e273" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov24_21@8-9">Cum detractoribus.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov24-Qd1e276"><seg type="qs">Cum illis scilicet</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">et auscultantium illis auditorum.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov24-Dd1e285">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov24-Hd1e287">Versus 23</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov24-d1e289">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov24-Qd1e291" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov24_23@1-3">Haec quoque sapientibus.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov24-Qd1e294"><seg type="qs">Quando reprobus quis repentino interitu rapitur a saeculo</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">vel timore nunquam a via veritatis recedatur.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov24-Dd1e303">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov24-Hd1e305">Versus 26</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov24-d1e307">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov24-Qd1e309" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov24_26@1-2">Labia deosculabitur.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov24-Qd1e312"><seg type="qs">Osculum pacis et amoris signum est</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">in melius conversos.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov24-Dd1e321">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov24-Hd1e323">Versus 27</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov24-d1e325">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov24-Qd1e327" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov24_27@1-1">Praepara.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov24-Qd1e330"><seg type="qs">Praeparato opere agrum <pb ed="#P" n="1108B"/> diligenter exercere</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">intus tota virtutum fabrica fame boni crescente destruatur.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov24-Dd1e341">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov24-Hd1e343">Versus 30</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov24-d1e345">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov24-Qd1e347" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov24_30@1-5">Per agrum hominis pigri transivi,</quote>
            etc. <quote xml:id="gom-prov24-Qd1e350"><seg type="qs">Per agrum vineamque pigri ac stulti transire</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">vel diaboli persuasione quisque negligens perdit.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </body>
